{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16982","headline":"甫构西亭偶题因呈监军及幕中诸公 · 武元衡","name":"甫构西亭偶题因呈监军及幕中诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瀛海无因泛，崑丘岂易寻。\n数峰聊在目，一境暂清心。\n悦彼松柏性，爱兹桃李阴。\n列芳凭有土，丛干聚成林。\n信矣子牟恋，归欤尼父吟。\n暗香兰露滴，空翠蕙楼深。\n负鼎位尝忝，荷戈年屡侵。\n百城烦鞅掌，九仞喜岖嶔。\n巴汉泝沿楫，岷峨千万岑。\n恩偏不敢去，范蠡畏熔金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16982.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16982","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}